*> vybe-test: cobol/inspect_advanced/test_inspect_tallying_spaces
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_inspect_advanced.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-STR PIC X(10) VALUE "A B C D  ".
01 WS-CNT PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    INSPECT WS-STR TALLYING WS-CNT FOR ALL " ".
    DISPLAY WS-CNT.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-CNT DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "005"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [005] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

